# Aled's OK is required

Aled Morgan owns candooka.world. Agents forget this and ship planner, login, or live-account changes he did not ask for. Stop.

## Hard stops unless Aled explicitly asked in this conversation

- Do not change 3D swath shooting, route order, headings, Survey Criteria 3D defaults, or `planSwathBlockRacetracks`.
- Do not POST to `users.php`, change live account roles/passwords, or edit `users-db.json`.
- Do not deploy to the VPS / candooka.world (`deploy.sh`, rsync, SSH).
- Do not "improve" a working flow, retarget a PR, or merge behaviour from another draft PR.

If he asked a question, answer it. If he asked to lock a rule, only add the rule/tests. Do not implement extra product changes as a side effect.

## Draft PRs

Open a draft PR only for work he asked for. Leave other draft PRs (3D Auto, stadium returns, login restore, etc.) untouched until he says to use them.
